  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.10 Community water system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.10 “Community water system” means “community water system” as defined in RSA 485:1-a, I, namely, “a public water system which serves at least 15 service connections used by year-round residents or regularly serves at least 25 year-round residents.”\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
